# Page navigation

Before creating or implementing a plan that adds, removes, renames, or re-nests a screen, route, tab, or purchase guard, read `docs/page-navigation.md`.

That file wins over older route lists in `Veteran_Claims_Buddy_Engineering_Handoff.md` and over any new plan.

If the work conflicts with the map:

1. Stop before scaffolding or coding the conflicting part.
2. Tell the owner what the map says and what the new plan would do instead.
3. Wait for a decision.
4. If the map should change, update `docs/page-navigation.md` in the same change. Do not leave a second navigation plan somewhere else.

`/plans` is the only Premium versus per-Case sales page. Do not add another paywall screen.
